# What this plugin is, for the index in README.md and for whoever installs
# it alone. One key per line; the Makefile beside it does the installing.
name: xymonapi-agent
version: 0.1.0
side: client
summary: one command that asks an AI agent -- Claude Code, Codex or opencode, headless -- a question about Xymon, with the MCP server as its only tool
requires: xymonapi-mcp >= 0.1.0 (beside it, with xymonapi's client); one of the agent CLIs, installed and logged in; python >= 3.9
manual: xymonapi-agent.1
